{"ref":"BDB, תְּנוּמָה","hw":"תְּנוּמָה","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תְּנוּמָה</span></big>  <strong>n.f. slumber</strong>;—abs. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 132:4\" href=\"/Psalms.132.4\">ψ 132:4</a> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.4\">Pr 6:4</a>; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּנוּמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.10\">Pr 6:10</a> + 2 times;—<em>slumber</em> as time of visions <a data-ref=\"Job 33:15\" href=\"/Job.33.15\">Jb 33:15</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּרְדֵּמָה</span>); of indolent slumber <a data-ref=\"Psalms 132:4\" href=\"/Psalms.132.4\">ψ 132:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁנָת</span>) <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:4\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.4\">Pr 6:4</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁנה</span>) in both c. <span dir=\"rtl\">נָתַן</span>, sq. acc. + <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 6:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.6.10\">6:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 24:33\" href=\"/Proverbs.24.33\">24:33</a> (both ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁנות</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁכב</span>).","next":"BDB, יָנוּם","prev":"BDB, נוּמָה"}